Spec: Theme

Purpose:
  Retrail's design tokens and Material 3 theme for light and dark mode.

Owns:
  ./app_colors.dart
  ./app_shapes.dart
  ./app_theme.dart
  ./app_typography.dart
  ./theme_context.dart
  /test/theme

References:
  /docs/specs/history/02-design-system.md
  /docs/specs/history/design-tokens.md

Must:
  Colours are tokens in the @AppColors `ThemeExtension`, read with `context.colors`; code without a
    `BuildContext` reads @AppColors.light or @AppColors.dark.
  Dynamic colour is off; both themes use the brand colours.
  The theme mode (system, light, dark) is chosen by the user and persisted.
  Shapes come from @AppShapes: radius `14` hero card and route maps, `12` cards and stat cells, `50` pills,
    chips and the nav indicator, `10` small containers and dialog inputs, `20` dialogs.
  Text styles map to the Material 3 type scale through @AppTypography.
  Floating map buttons use the app surface with a primary icon, so they follow the theme.
  Snack bars float as cards through `snackBarTheme`.
